    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12565" root="دعب" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُعْبُبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُعَابَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَاعِبٌ</span>: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُعْبُوبٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also <i>A good,</i> or <i>an excellent, singer.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>A youth soft</i> or <i>tender, thin-skinned,</i> or
<i>fine-shinned, and plump.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  The <i>fruit of
a certain plant:</i> (K:) or (K, TA) the <i>plant
itself, namely,</i> (TA,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنِبُ الثَّعْلَبِ</span>; [see art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثعلب</span>;] (K, TA;) of the dial. of El-Yemen.
(TA.)

